<title>UK: Mexico's Pemex sets $250 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex sets $250 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Goldman Sachs and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PETROLEOS MEXICANOS</p>
<p> AMT     $250 MLN     COUPON     **	  MATURITY    30.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  45 B	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+160 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB	  DENOMS (K) **	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/MX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  MEXICO    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PCT 2002 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>GUARANTEED BY  PEMEX EXPLORATION PRODUCCION, PEMEX REFINACION</p>
<p>AND PEMEX</p>
<p>		    GAS PETROQUIMICA BASCA</p>
<p> NOTES	**REG S ONE (K), 144A 100 (K), ONE (K) MULTIPLES</p>
<p>THEREAFTER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
